@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix sh: <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

<http://shaclshapes.org/AthleteShape> a sh:NodeShape ;
    sh:property [ sh:class <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/Place> ;
            sh:path <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/deathPlace> ],
